flowchart LR
    GH[GitHub deployment\nor controlled demo event] --> IN[Public Cloud Run\nIngress]
    IN -->|canonical event| PS[Pub/Sub]
    PS -->|authenticated push| WK[Private Cloud Run\nWorker]
