    EV --> ADK[Google ADK\nGemini 3.7 Flash]
    ADK --> POL[Deterministic policy gate]
    POL -->|allowed only| GHI[GitHub Issues\ncreate / comment / close]
    WK <--> FS[(Firestore\nevents / runs / evidence / incidents / actions)]
    WK --> CT[Cloud Tasks]
    CT -->|OIDC /internal/verify| WK
    WK -->|fresh audit| VAL
    DEMO[Cloud Run demo target\nhealthy / broken tags] -. audited .-> VAL
